            <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <h2>Screw vs. other Displacement</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Moving parts all rotate and hence can run at much higher speeds</li>
                    <li>Contact forces within them are low</li>
                    <li>Sealing lines of contact which define the boundaries of each cell chamber, decrease in length as the size of the working chamber decreases and the pressure within it rises</li>
                    <li>Rolling motion discourages seizure</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
