        <ul>
            <li>Wet inlet conditions are permissible</li>
            <li>Adiabatic efficiency can be very similar to turbines</li>
            <li>Improved rotor profiles mean greater efficiency</li>
            <li>Lower tip speeds, lower overall speed</li>
            <li>Mass produced</li>
            <li>Efficient with varying loads</li>
            <li>Long service life</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="float: right; margin-top: 20px;">
