                    <li>Full tightness, small blow-hole area, large displacement, short sealing lines, small confined volumes, involute rotor contact and proper gate rotor torque distribution together with high rotor mechanical rigidity</li>
                    <li>Design also involves mathematical modeling to determine the optimum rotor size and speed, shape and position of the suction and discharge ports, taking into account of the limitations imposed by bearing and seal selection.</li>
